Description: Cockpit module to manage a Samba Active Directory domain controller
 A Cockpit page that runs on the domain controller and manages users,
 groups, computers, home directories and shared folders, with network
 drives mapped at logon through a Group Policy Object.
 .
 It drives the local Samba tools (samba-tool, ldbsearch, net conf) as
 root through Cockpit and reads the directory from the local sam.ldb, so
 it needs no domain credentials.
